## When to Use

- Dashboard views with multiple metrics
- Detail/profile views
- Data tables and lists
- Activity logs and timelines
- Status overviews
- Any high-density information display

## Design Principles Summary

| Principle | Implementation |
|-----------|----------------|
| Grid structure | 12-column CSS Grid with column-gap only |
| Vertical rhythm | Section padding, not row gaps |
| Tight grouping | 2px-4px gaps within blocks |
| Column separation | 1px vertical dividers + padding |
| Typography | 5-level scale: display → label |
| Status colors | Solid badges, tinted alerts |
| Minimal decoration | No icons in data cells, clean dividers |
